msgid "The companion sample project for this post is available on https://github.com/apache/camel-quarkus-examples/tree/main/quarkus-to-camel-quarkus[GitHub]. It has two modules: `quarkus-orders` (the starting point) and `camel-quarkus-orders` (the result). Clone it, then `cd camel-quarkus-orders && mvn quarkus:dev` to see both routes in action."
